laws bc_sat_areab_only sub_sat_emission_ns diode_wl_mult_once diode_sidewall_own_f1 diode_xom_absent_1e14 vdmos_kp_absent_20 vdmos_tcvth_raises vdmos_clamp_by_fc mos_small_signal_exact mos6_small_signal_exact bjt_irb_small_signal_exact vdmos_mult_charges_copies diode_isr_reverse_present diode_isr_small_signal_exact diode_tt_factor_clamped trig_exact exp_exact log_zero_error div_exact asin_edge_fails default_temp_27 default_tnom_27 bsim4v45_small_signal_exact
# Oracle: settle devices_prc (run prc: each field below moves the number as ngspice-45's R, C,
# L do: ΔT = T − tnom, the direct law, `scale` multiplies R); the `spice/*.va` aliases (`r`
# for `resistance`, `tc1` for `tc`, `noise` for `noisy`, `l` for `inductance`); S 7.11 (an
# unknown parameter: InvalidInSource P2103); `noisy=2` has no IR field (Private P2106); run fwd
# (a terminal left unconnected: Private P2104, R41 Q3); settle fwd_module (one too many:
# "Too many terminals specified at instantiation.", InvalidInSource P2109). The numbers are settle devices_prc's
# (whose simulator round trip the settle test runs).
# codes: P2103 P2104 P2106 P2109 S0002 S0002 S0004 S0004
file "passives.sim" deck
  title "resistors capacitors inductors"
  device_library resistor
  device_library capacitor
  device_library inductor
  model r resistor
  model c capacitor
  model l inductor
  element resistor r1 (n1 0) model=r value=1k tc1=0.01 tc2=0.001
  element resistor r2 (n2 0) model=r value=1k tce=1i noisy=false
  element resistor r3 (n3 0) model=r params=(w=2u l=1u) value=1k tc1=0.01 temp_abs=77i
  element resistor r4 (n4 0) model=r mult=2i dtemp=10i scale=2i value=1k
  element resistor rc1 (c1 0) model=r value=1e12
  element capacitor c1 (c1 0) model=c mult=2i value=1n tc1=0.01
  element inductor l1 (l1 0) model=l value=1m temp_abs=77i scale=3i
  opaque vacask invalid "rb (n1 0) r r=1k bogus=1"
  opaque vacask private "rn (n1 0) r r=1k noisy=2"
  opaque vacask private "rt (n1) r r=1k"
  opaque vacask invalid "rl (n1 n2 0) r r=1k"
